   ]
  }
 ],
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_4be19a07",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Owen!! Hope spring is treating you well 🌱 Quick lead for you: the lot behind the hardware store on 38th St had a salt pile sitting UNCOVERED all winter, and now every time it rains it washes straight into the storm drain 😩 Is that something anyone would want to write about?? 🧂💧 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-05-08T01:18:42.517000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_d3027c5e",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "Thanks, Dana. It's a good detail. I don't have a salt story going right now, but I keep a file. If you take photos, note the date on each one.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-05-08T13:41:15.204000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_8f6a41b2",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Will do!!! I already have a few from March 💪 Our spring sweep-up is next Saturday, we'll be collecting leftover salt all over Longfellow if you want to see it in action!! #SaltSmart - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-05-08T17:07:33.869000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_1c95e7d0",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Did you see the district's 2025 water quality report came out yesterday?? Corliss AND Penner are now OVER the state chloride standard 😬😬 This is what we've been saying for YEARS!!! Our sweep-up crew collected 11 buckets of leftover salt in May, imagine how much is going into the lakes 💧🧂 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-06-13T00:55:06.731000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_a7403f6b",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "I saw the notice, but I haven't been through the report yet. Eleven buckets is a lot of salt for one neighborhood.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-06-13T14:12:27.390000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_5e2bd918",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "SO much!!! This winter we're doing sidewalk audits too, you should tag along sometime 😉 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-06-13T15:30:51.112000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_c06f3a84",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Owen!! Would you ever come talk at a Salt Watch meetup this fall?? Like 20 minutes on how to read a water quality report?? People would LOVE it 🙌💧 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-07-22T01:26:19.645000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_92d17e5c",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "Thanks for asking. I'm going to pass. I may end up writing about salt, and Salt Watch with it, so I try to keep some distance from groups I could cover.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-07-22T13:58:44.083000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_3b8c06fa",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Totally get it, journalist rules 😂 Do you know anyone who could do it instead?? - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-07-22T17:40:02.958000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_e41a92d7",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "The watershed district does public talks. Their press office can set one up.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-07-22T22:15:37.426000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_7d5f20c3",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Random question!! Do you know if Prairie Wire runs community items?? Our fall smart salting trainings are FREE this year for HOA boards and property managers 🙌🧂 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-08-20T01:02:55.307000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_0a96bd41",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "They do, through their community calendar rather than through me. Send it to their news desk with the dates and who can sign up.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-08-20T14:05:18.776000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_f2c74e19",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Perfect, THANK YOU!!! 💧 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-08-20T17:31:40.251000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_6b31a5e8",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_owen",
   "text": "Dana, I'm reporting a piece on road salt and Twin Cities lakes for North Current, due in November. If you hear of anyone tracking how much salt cities or HOAs actually use, I'd like to know.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-24T00:20:09.684000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_b8e2079d",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6d2e8b1f",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "OMG YES!!! FINALLY someone is covering this!!! 🙌🙌 I have SO many people for you. Remember our blog post on applicators, the one I emailed you? They put down something like 40% of the salt in the metro!! Let me dig up the link 🧂💧 - D",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-24T00:34:47.139000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
